  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 1033(a)(2)(B), the replacement period for involuntary conversions generally ends 2 years after the close of the first taxable year in which any part of the gain is realized. The taxpayer must purchase property similar or related in service or use.
